## Why This Is Asked
Tests hands-on ability to weave Azure AI, policy governance, and regulatory constraints into a live assistant that scales per tenant and remains auditable.

## Key Concepts
- Azure OpenAI behind API Management
- Grounding with Cognitive Search over versioned KB in Blob
- Per-tenant policy gating via Key Vault keys
- PII redaction with Text Analytics
- Audit logs in Data Lake
- Fallback to sanitized checklist on gate/confidence failure

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: gate checks before OpenAI call
function shouldFallback(prompt, budget, policy) {
  if (policy.violationDetected) return true;
  if (estimateCost(prompt) > budget) return true;
  if (promptContainsPII(prompt)) return true;
  return false;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test per-tenant isolation and key management across regional deployments?
- How would you validate redaction quality without leaking schemas or patterns to vendors?

